<title>ST KITTS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BASSETERRE, St Kitts 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the second day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Friday.</p>
<p>In Basseterre: Barbados 275 (Roland Holder 107),   Leeward</p>
<p>Islands 124-7.</p>
<p>In Discovery Bay, Jamaica: Windward Islands 117 and 103-7, Jamaica 276 (Robert Samuels 69; Casper Davis 7-58).</p>
</text>
